ALBUKHR Project Eligibility & U2A Guard Specification
Version: 1.0
Status: Read-only audit / implementation proposal — NOT approved for deployment
Scope: Core, Internal, External Projects; Mainnet and Testnet; dApp Launch Service separation
Change controls: No GitHub writes, Supabase writes/migrations, Storage changes, live Pi payments, or deployment are authorized by this document.
1. Purpose
Ensure no ALBUKHR project can accept a Mainnet investment/staking payment unless the authoritative Mainnet project record is ACTIVE and all applicable investment-readiness gates pass. Projects in APPROVED status may be tested in the ALBUKHR Testnet environment only, using Testnet-only infrastructure and data.
This contract must be enforced in the browser, API gateway, and settlement RPC/database transaction. UI-only protection is not sufficient.
